OL,3,GNEWSAKing welcomes AI leaders to
OL,4,AAyrshire summit and urges them to
OL,5,Aprotect humanity in address
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King welcomes AI leaders to a
OL,8,Fsummit in Ayrshire, Scotland - images
OL,9,Fshow him speaking to tech figures
OL,10,Fincluding Nvidia's Jensen Huang
OL,12,FIn opening remarks, the monarch urges
OL,13,Ftech bosses to protect humanity and
OL,14,F"not lose control of our destiny"
OL,16,FThere have been a slew of recent
OL,17,Fwarnings about the dangers AI poses for
OL,18,Fhumans - here's a recap of the debate
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
